#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang/0x1a3e77/0xff02ff
msgid "Change jet packs. You can store up to 3 jet packs in your inventory."
msgstr "更换喷气背包。库存最多可存 3 个喷气背包。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang/0x1a3e77/0xff0300
msgid "Change radomes. You can store up to 3 radomes in your inventory."
msgstr "更换雷达罩。库存最多可存 3 个雷达罩。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang/0x1a3e77/0xff0301
msgid "Add additional armor. You can store up to 3 sets of armor in your inventory."
msgstr "加装装甲。库存最多可存 3 套装甲。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_develop_metal_en.olang/0x1a3e77/0xff0302
msgid "Change railguns. You can store up to 3 railguns in your inventory."
msgstr "更换电磁炮。库存最多可存 3 门电磁炮。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x01487a
msgid "My name is Paz, and I'll do anything to protect my namesake."
msgstr "我叫帕兹，我会不惜一切保护我的同名者。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x0b58fc
#, c-format
msgid "70% of my existence is made of movies."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x255cf9
msgid "My father worked on the Manhattan Project."
msgstr "我父亲参与过曼哈顿计划。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c631
msgid "Give me any order you want. I'll make it happen."
msgstr "随便下什么命令，我都给你办到。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c632
msgid "I left my hometown and haven't looked back."
msgstr "我离开家乡后就没再回头。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c633
msgid "I'm good to go as long as I have three square meals."
msgstr "只要一天三顿管饱，我就没问题。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c634
msgid "I'm going to be taking a good look at your command style."
msgstr "我会好好看看你的指挥风格。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c635
msgid "Male, female... I heard it doesn't matter out here. I heard you'll use us just the same."
msgstr "男的女的……听说在这儿都一样。听说你会一视同仁地用我们。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c636
msgid "What's your sidearm of choice? A handgun? Or, maybe a submachine gun?"
msgstr "你配枪选什么？手枪？还是冲锋枪？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c637
msgid "I'm so sleepy..."
msgstr "我好困……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c638
msgid "I'll go berserk if my pay's late."
msgstr "工资晚发我就发飙。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c639
msgid "Just so you know, I'm only here to pay for my kid brother's education, so spare me the cheesy battlefield romance."
msgstr "先说清楚，我来这只是为了供弟弟上学，别跟我搞什么战场上的肉麻恋情。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c650
msgid "I caught a whiff of an ocean breeze..."
msgstr "我闻到了海风的味道……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c651
msgid "I won't disappoint you, and that's a promise."
msgstr "我不会让你失望，这是承诺。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c652
msgid "Can't say I'm impressed by anyone here. I guess I'll have to help you out."
msgstr "这里没一个让我看得上眼的。看来只能我来帮你了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c653
msgid "I used to work in a kitchen. Whether it's guns or knives, just leave it to me."
msgstr "我以前在厨房干过。枪也好刀也好，交给我就行。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c654
msgid "Let's square off in the ring next chance we have!"
msgstr "下次有机会在拳台上较量一场！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c655
msgid "You do have a good medic, don't you? I mean, people die all the time from minor wounds that get infected. You gotta have a good medic."
msgstr "你有好军医吧？小伤感染死人可是常事。必须得有好军医。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c656
msgid "My mom was a fighter pilot."
msgstr "我妈是战斗机飞行员。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c657
msgid "I don't choose sides. Whoever needs me, that's where I go."
msgstr "我不站队。谁需要我，我就去哪。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c658
msgid "I'm prepared to die for you!"
msgstr "我愿为你而死！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c659
msgid "I like that look you have in your eyes, Boss!"
msgstr "BOSS，我喜欢你眼里的那股劲！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c670
msgid "I majored in quantum mechanics, and I'm continuing my studies on the side."
msgstr "我主修量子力学，现在还在业余继续研究。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c671
msgid "The sky's so blue again today."
msgstr "今天天空又这么蓝。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c672
#, c-format
msgid "Did you know that 65% of the world's top assassins are women?"
msgstr "你知道世界顶尖杀手里65%是女性吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c673
msgid "I may not look it, but I took third in a national weightlifting tournament."
msgstr "看不出来吧，我拿过全国举重锦标赛第三名。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c674
msgid "I have a proven track record. No matter the mission, I'll deliver the goods."
msgstr "我有实绩。不管什么任务，我都能办妥。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c675
msgid "Today is your lucky day. I'm going to join your unit!"
msgstr "今天你走运了。我要加入你的部队！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c676
msgid "My mother's in the hospital, so send me somewhere the pay's good. I don't care how dangerous it is."
msgstr "我妈住院了，派我去报酬高的地方吧。多危险都无所谓。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c677
msgid "Our rations include tea and scones, right?"
msgstr "我们的口粮里有茶和司康饼吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c678
msgid "So you're that Boss I heard about. It's an honor to meet you."
msgstr "你就是传闻中的那位BOSS吧。很荣幸见到你。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c679
msgid "I smelled gallo pinto earlier. Is that what's for dinner?"
msgstr "我闻到豆饭味了。晚饭就吃那个？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c690
msgid "I heard you train with unlimited live fire. That true?"
msgstr "听说你们训练用无限实弹。真的吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c691
msgid "If you're out of rations, why not have a snack instead? Like curry - mmm, can't get enough!"
msgstr "口粮不够的话，不如吃点零食？比如咖喱——嗯，怎么吃都不腻！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c692
msgid "The more you use a certain weapon, the more of its natural power will be unleashed. Interesting... I'll have to remember that."
msgstr "武器用得越多，越能发挥出它本来的力量。有意思……我得记住这点。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c693
msgid "I don't like my hair to get messed up, but for you, I'll go fight."
msgstr "我不喜欢头发被弄乱，但为了你，我去战斗。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c694
msgid "Getting the highest clear rank means not killing, not being seen, and moving quickly. You can do it, Boss!"
msgstr "拿到最高评价意味着不杀人、不被发现、快速行动。你能做到的，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c695
msgid "There's more than one way to \"neutralize\" somebody, right, Boss? You can knock 'em out with a stun rod, or put 'em to sleep with a tranq gun, or sneak up from behind and hold 'em up..."
msgstr "制伏敌人的方法不止一种，对吧，BOSS？可以用电击棒打晕，用麻醉枪让他睡着，或者从背后悄悄靠近挟持……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c696
msgid "If it's taking too long to aim, switch to AUTO AIM. That's what's kept me alive all this time."
msgstr "瞄准太慢的话，就切到自动瞄准。我就是靠这个活到现在的。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c697
msgid "The \"3 Slot\" weapon select takes some getting used to, but once you get the hang of it, it's a cinch. And boy, is it deadly!"
msgstr "“3槽”武器切换需要点时间适应，但上手之后就轻松了。而且，天哪，太致命了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c698
msgid "There's nothing like sleep for recovering LIFE! And if you can't sleep, lie down and stay still! Isn't that right, sir?"
msgstr "恢复生命值最好的办法就是睡觉！睡不着的话，躺下别动！对吧，长官？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c699
msgid "The more you use a weapon, the more of a feel you get for it. Eventually, it gets so it's almost a part of your body..."
msgstr "武器用得越多，就越有手感。到最后，它几乎成了你身体的一部分……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b0
msgid "Sometimes a single word to your comrades can change the course of a battle... Wow, Boss, you always see things the rest of us don't."
msgstr "有时对同伴说一句话就能改变战局……哇，BOSS，你总能看到我们看不到的东西。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b1
msgid "You're never too busy to attend a briefing! See, Boss? I got it memorized!"
msgstr "再忙也不能缺席简报！看吧，BOSS？我都记住了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b2
msgid "Sir, I like the M16A1 for its low recoil. What's your favorite weapon, Boss?"
msgstr "长官，我喜欢M16A1后坐力小。你最爱哪把枪，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b3
msgid "You ever sneak up behind an enemy and ZAP 'em with the stun rod? Gives me the shivers every time!"
msgstr "你有没有从背后悄悄靠近敌人，用电击棒电他们？每次都让我浑身发麻！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b4
msgid "Life is all about experience! Come to think of it, I guess that goes for drills, too... ugghh, I hate drills..."
msgstr "人生全靠经验！说起来，训练大概也一样……呃，我讨厌训练……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b5
msgid "Do you believe in fate? Right now, I think I could."
msgstr "你信命运吗？现在，我信了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b6
msgid "I believe in you, Boss. Under your command, gender means nothing."
msgstr "我相信你，BOSS。在你的指挥下，性别毫无意义。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b7
msgid "I just don't know what I'm good at... Can you tell what my skills are, Boss?"
msgstr "我不知道自己擅长啥……你能看出我技能吗，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b8
msgid "Staring at me's not going to do anything. Penny for your thoughts, sir."
msgstr "盯着我看也没用。说说你在想什么吧，长官。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6b9
msgid "Orders, Boss?"
msgstr "有什么命令吗，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d0
msgid "I usually hate doing things for other people. But for you, Boss, I'll do anything."
msgstr "我通常讨厌替别人做事。但为了你，BOSS，我什么都愿意做。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d1
msgid "I always saw myself as a lone wolf. But I guess people's values can change pretty quick. Lord knows I've changed since I came here."
msgstr "我一直把自己当成独狼。但人的价值观大概变得很快。自从来到这里，我确实变了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d2
msgid "I'm not the type to follow orders. Unless you're giving them, Boss."
msgstr "我不服从命令。除非是你下的，BOSS。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d3
msgid "I'm burning for some action! Got a mission for me?"
msgstr "我渴望行动！有任务给我吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d4
msgid "I like it here. It's a nice place."
msgstr "我喜欢这里。好地方。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d5
msgid "Do you believe in horoscopes? Me, I only believe in you."
msgstr "你相信星座吗？我嘛，只相信你。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d6
msgid "What do you see in those eyes of yours...? Sorry, didn't mean to get personal."
msgstr "你那双眼睛看到了什么……？抱歉，不该问这么私人的事。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d7
msgid "When things get tough, think of me. That might ease the pain a little."
msgstr "遇到困难时，想想我。也许能减轻一点痛苦。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d8
msgid "I can be kind of stubborn, but I'm a survivor, too."
msgstr "我可能有点固执，但我也是个幸存者。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6d9
msgid "People say I'm a little CRRRRRAZY..."
msgstr "大家都说我有点疯……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f0
msgid "I heard you're scared of vampires - is that true? Aww... that's actually kind of cute, Boss!"
msgstr "听说你怕吸血鬼——真的吗？哎呀……其实还挺可爱的，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f1
msgid "Don't underestimate me because I'm a woman. We ladies can fight in ways you men can't!"
msgstr "别因为我是女人就小看我。我们女人有你们男人做不到的打法！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f2
msgid "Oh... Boss..."
msgstr "哦……BOSS……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f3
msgid "Give me a mission, and I'll do everything I can to get it done!"
msgstr "给我任务，我会尽全力完成！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f4
msgid "Boss! Send me out into the field! I'm going crazy just sitting around here! My legs are starting to cramp up!"
msgstr "BOSS！派我上战场吧！光坐在这里我要疯了！腿都开始抽筋了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f5
msgid "Boss! Send me into the field! I promise I'll come back alive!"
msgstr "BOSS！派我上战场！我保证活着回来！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f6
msgid "Comrade-in-stealth... it's got a nice ring to it."
msgstr "潜行战友……听起来不错。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f7
msgid "You know, Commander Miller is actually kind of cute when he takes off those sunglasses."
msgstr "你知道吗，米勒指挥官摘下墨镜其实还挺帅的。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x33c6f8
msgid "My hobby is gardening."
msgstr "爱好是园艺。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374631
msgid "I'm your man! Give me an order, I'll get it done!"
msgstr "交给我吧！下命令，我搞定！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374632
msgid "I am hyped!! Let's do this!!!"
msgstr "我热血沸腾！！来吧！！！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374633
msgid "Need a...helping hand?"
msgstr "要…帮忙吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374634
msgid "I left some of my buddies behind on the last battlefield..."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374635
msgid "I got a daughter. She's going to be 12 next year. I have to make it out of this alive!"
msgstr "我有个女儿。明年就12岁了。我必须活着回去！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374636
msgid "I used to be a sailor. Best pair of eyes on the seas!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374637
msgid "I'm a weapons technician."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374638
msgid "Give me a mission, Boss!"
msgstr "给我任务，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374639
msgid "I'm a martial arts expert - I know Combat Sambo and I'm a fifth degree black belt in karate!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374650
msgid "My grandpa was a mechanic. I can take an air-cooled engine apart in five minutes flat!"
msgstr "我爷爷是机械师，风冷引擎我五分钟就能拆完！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374651
msgid "I got back from Vietnam and found I had no place to call home anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374652
msgid "I went through hell in 'Nam... I'm ready for anything!"
msgstr "我在越南吃尽了苦头……什么都不怕了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374653
msgid "I was an Officer Candidate. Not much combat experience, but I speak seven languages."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374654
msgid "Need a dentist?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374655
msgid "Costa Rica is full of swamps... make sure we got a good supply of dry socks."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374656
msgid "You're good. Better than I expected."
msgstr "你很强，比我预想的还强。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374657
msgid "As much as I hate to say it, it's war that gives us our greatest breakthroughs in science and technology."
msgstr "说来惭愧，正是战争带来了科学与技术最大的突破。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374658
msgid "I know it takes more than weapons to make us strong and all, but at least give us some decent gear, alright? "
msgstr "我知道光靠武器强大不起来，但至少给点像样的装备吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374659
msgid "Heh... Imagine. If only we had a guy like you running the country..."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374670
msgid "You look like you'll come in handy. I guess I'll stick around and help you out."
msgstr "你看着挺有用，我就留下来帮你吧。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374671
msgid "Gotta get your hands dirty to win a war..."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374672
msgid "We can do better than this."
msgstr "我们能做得更好。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374673
msgid "You? A sneaking master?! Are you kidding me?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374674
msgid "I can smell it... The smell of blood...  Lots of blood..."
msgstr "我闻得到……血的味道……好多血……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374675
msgid "Ready when you are, Boss."
msgstr "随时待命，BOSS。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374676
msgid "Well, I've earned MY check... Time for a nap..."
msgstr "总算挣到工钱了……睡一觉……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374677
msgid "Guns kill people? Bro, sometimes guns are the only things that save lives."
msgstr "枪会杀人？兄弟，有时枪是唯一能救命的东西。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374678
msgid "I used to be a world-class gymnast, you know."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374679
msgid "When this fight's over, I'm gonna go back home and find myself a wife..."
msgstr "这场仗打完，我就回家找个老婆……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374690
msgid "I still haven't made up my mind about you yet."
msgstr "我还没想好怎么看你。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374691
msgid "I can tell that you're not in this 'cause you like the smell of hot lead. Am I right?"
msgstr "我看得出来，你干这行不是因为喜欢闻火药味。对吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374692
msgid "Just so you know, the more praise I get, the better I do."
msgstr "告诉你，夸奖越多，我干得越好。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374693
msgid "Drinks later? It's on me."
msgstr "回头喝一杯？我请客。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374694
msgid "Think you can take advantage of my skills?"
msgstr "想利用我的本事？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374695
msgid "Balls to the wall, boys!"
msgstr "拼了命上，兄弟们！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374696
msgid "Let's see, my horoscope says today's going to be... OK, I guess."
msgstr "让我看看，我的星座运势说今天会……还行吧。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374697
msgid "C'mon, give me a mission! My rifle's getting all rusty!"
msgstr "来吧，给我个任务！我的枪都快生锈了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374698
msgid "Things are never better than when they're ordinary."
msgstr "平平淡淡才是最好。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374699
msgid "I... I don't wanna fight. I wanna be a cook."
msgstr "我……我不想打仗。我想当厨师。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b0
msgid "Hey Boss, at dinner do you eat your favorite food first, or save it for last?"
msgstr "嘿，BOSS，吃饭时你先吃最爱吃的，还是留到最后？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b1
msgid "You're like a knife out of its sheath, you know that?"
msgstr "你就像出鞘的刀，知道吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b2
msgid "My muscles never fail me."
msgstr "我的肌肉从不让我失望。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b3
msgid "(I'm too shy to talk to people... I believe in you, Boss...)"
msgstr "（我太害羞，不敢跟人说话……我相信你，BOSS……）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b4
msgid "We're gonna make a name for ourselves!"
msgstr "我们要闯出名堂来！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b5
msgid "Look, Boss! I caught a male Elephant Beetle, the world's heaviest insect!"
msgstr "看，BOSS！我抓到一只公象兜虫，世界上最重的昆虫！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b6
msgid "Happy to be on board with you, Boss."
msgstr "很高兴能跟你并肩作战，BOSS。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b7
msgid "It's good to have comrades...especially on the battlefield."
msgstr "有同志真好……尤其是在战场上。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b8
msgid "Don't worry, I got your back!"
msgstr "别担心，我掩护你！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746b9
msgid "Boss, if there's anything I can do to help make our technology better, I'll do it."
msgstr "BOSS，只要能帮咱们的技术更上一层楼，我什么都愿意做。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d0
msgid "Good eats everyday!"
msgstr "天天吃好的！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d1
msgid "You want to know how to raise morale around here?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d2
msgid "It's a real honor fighting with you..."
msgstr "能跟你一起战斗真荣幸……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d3
msgid "Sometimes, I get to thinking. What is human life in the face of truly great scientific research?"
msgstr "有时我会想。在真正伟大的科学研究面前，人的生命算什么？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d4
msgid "Welcome back! I made something new for dinner today - want to try some?"
msgstr "欢迎回来！今天晚饭我做了新花样——要尝尝吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d5
msgid "You're one smart customer, man!"
msgstr "你真精明，老兄！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d6
msgid "I'm former SAS... what you think I'm B.S.-ing you?"
msgstr "我以前是SAS的……你觉得我在吹牛？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d7
msgid "I'm proud to be counted as one of your comrades, Boss!"
msgstr "能成为你的同志，我很自豪，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d8
msgid "I...I can't believe I'm actually meeting you in person, Boss!"
msgstr "我……我真不敢相信能亲眼见到你，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746d9
msgid "(Just between you and me, I'm the guy who keeps MSF together...)"
msgstr "（只跟你说，MSF全靠我撑着……）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f0
msgid "You stay here. I'll have this next mission wrapped up in no time."
msgstr "你留在这。下次任务我马上就能搞定。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f1
msgid "This mission's nothing. I could do it with my eyes closed."
msgstr "这任务不算什么。我闭着眼都能完成。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f2
msgid "Boss, I've been meaning to tell you... nah, forget it. It's nothing."
msgstr "BOSS，我一直想跟你说……算了，没什么。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f3
msgid "I owe you one. Guess I better come with you."
msgstr "我欠你一次。看来我得跟你一起去。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f4
msgid "Who'd have thought being stealthy could be such a thrill..."
msgstr "谁能想到潜行居然这么刺激……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f5
msgid "I actually kind of like the way you fight."
msgstr "其实我还挺喜欢你的打法。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f6
msgid "I'll show you how to get it done the smart way!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f7
msgid "Back home, I'm a pretty well-known journalist."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f8
msgid "You look prettier every time I see you."
msgstr "每次见你，你都更漂亮了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x3746f9
msgid "Wish I could have met you sooner..."
msgstr "真希望能早点遇见你……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374710
msgid "Listen, I never actually hated you..."
msgstr "听着，我没真恨过你……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374711
msgid "It's all about the food. Give most guys a good meal and they won't complain. "
msgstr "关键在伙食。给大多数人一顿好饭，他们就不会抱怨。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374712
msgid "When this battle's over, I'm going to get my life together..."
msgstr "等这场战斗结束，我要重新好好过日子……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374713
#, c-format
msgid "Don't worry, my cooking's 100% safe for human consumption."
msgstr "放心，我做的饭百分之百能吃。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374714
msgid "I've...never been in a real fight before..."
msgstr "我……从来没真正打过架……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374715
msgid "If we met under different circumstances, I bet we could have been good friends."
msgstr "如果我们换个场合认识，说不定能成为好朋友。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374716
msgid "Eureka! My research is going to blow your mind, Boss!"
msgstr "我发现了！我的研究一定会让你大吃一惊，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374717
msgid "I just finished an incredible story! Could you read it and let me know what you think?"
msgstr "我刚写完一个超棒的故事！你能读读看，告诉我怎么样吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374718
msgid "Before I became a mercenary, I was a doctor. Would you like to try this new drug I'm working on?"
msgstr "当雇佣兵之前，我是医生。要不要试试我正在研发的新药？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374719
msgid "Quitting smoking is easy! Why, I've quit 20 times myself."
msgstr "戒烟很简单！我都戒过20次了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374730
msgid "I can't promise you I won't do bad things, but"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374731
msgid "Well now, looks like my boys gave you some trouble. Sorry 'bout that."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374732
msgid "Let's use our heads on this one."
msgstr "这事咱们得动动脑子。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374733
msgid "Everybody can do something, but nobody can do everything."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374734
msgid "Ah, Boss, glad you're here. We were short one guy tonight."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374735
msgid "You want me to forget last night...? Too late. It's all in my diary now."
msgstr "你想让我忘了昨晚……？太迟了。全写在我日记里了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374736
msgid "You're our greatest hope, Boss!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374737
msgid "What the hell, let's have fun out there!"
msgstr "管他呢，咱们好好玩一场！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374738
msgid "Ohhh... my stomach..."
msgstr "哦哦……我的胃……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374739
msgid "When we're all done here, I think I'm going to start my own business."
msgstr "等这里的事都结束了，我想自己开个店。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374750
msgid "Kill 'em, let 'em live... it's up to you. Either way, give 'em hell!!"
msgstr "杀还是放，由你定。不管怎样，狠狠打！！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374751
msgid "Awaiting orders, Boss!!"
msgstr "等命令，BOSS！！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374752
msgid "I'm bringin' home the bacon!"
msgstr "我要带着战利品回家啦！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374753
msgid "It's either us or them!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374754
msgid "Sometimes it's good to grab life by the horns."
msgstr "有时候就该放手一搏。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374755
msgid "Looks like another late night at the office..."
msgstr "看来又要在办公室熬夜了……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374756
msgid "You're number one, Boss. That makes me number two, right?"
msgstr "你是第一，BOSS。那我就是第二，对吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374757
msgid "198, 199, 200! Oh, hey, Boss, you're just in time!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374758
msgid "For the last time, stop treating me like a rookie!"
msgstr "最后说一次，别把我当新兵！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374759
msgid "I could learn to like this outfit."
msgstr "这身行头我能穿惯。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a30
msgid "Nothing feeds a developer like the sound of a satisfied user."
msgstr "用户满意的一句话，就是开发者最好的食粮。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a31
msgid "Why do it toda-a-ay? There's always tomorro-o-ow..."
msgstr "干嘛非今天做？还有明天嘛……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a32
msgid "Ahhh, we got a nice big catch today!"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a33
msgid "I love to grill things. My favorite food is stir-fried noodles."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a34
msgid "I'm saving up all the money I make here, so when I get back to the States, I can go to college..."
msgstr "我把在这里挣的钱都存着，等回美国就能上大学了……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a35
msgid "No need for you to go, Boss... I got this one covered."
msgstr "BOSS，你不用去……这个我来搞定。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a36
msgid "We're not blood related, but we're still family."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a37
msgid "This place can only hold so many bodies. So make sure you bring back the best you can find. At least as good as me."
msgstr "这地方只能装这么多人。所以带回来的兵越强越好，至少跟我一样。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a38
msgid "A lot of the most talented soldiers out there are in places where you can't recover them the usual way. I know there's gotta be some way to get them, but..."
msgstr "很多最有才华的士兵都在你无法用常规方式回收的地方。我知道肯定有办法招到他们，但……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a39
msgid "To get the higher-ranked weapons, you'll need to find the design specs and raise the level of the R&D Team. Guess you got your work cut out for you in the field and at Mother Base..."
msgstr "要获得更高等级的武器，你需要找到开发规格并提升研发班的等级。看来你在战场和母基地都有得忙了……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a50
msgid "From what I've heard, supposedly there's a way to have items and ammo delivered right to you in the middle of a mission..."
msgstr "据我所知，应该有办法在任务中途把物品和弹药直接送到你手上……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a51
msgid "Back in my old unit, the commander used to tell us at morning calisthenics: \"Whenever you're in trouble, hit the START button!!\""
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a52
msgid "I-I saw some gigantic footprints in the swamp around El Cenagal..."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a53
msgid "The other day, out of the blue we got a big box delivered to us."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a54
msgid "For me, there's no greater thrill than seeing your exploits in PLAYER DATA, Boss!"
msgstr "对我来说，在 PLAYER DATA 看你的战绩最刺激，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a55
msgid "With word about MSF going around, no wonder there are more volunteers who want to join."
msgstr "随着 MSF 的名声传开，难怪有更多志愿者想加入。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a56
msgid "I swear I saw fireworks last time I was in combat. Do they really make a weapon like that?"
msgstr "我发誓上次战斗时看到了烟花。他们真的造出了那种武器吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a57
msgid "When I fire my weapon, I never aim for the head. Can't recruit 'em if they're dead, after all."
msgstr "我开枪时从不瞄准头部。毕竟死了就没法招募了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a58
msgid "Some crates are too big to climb alone, but they're no problem if you got a buddy. Maybe that's what friendship is all about."
msgstr "有些箱子太大，一个人爬不上去，但有同伴就没问题。也许这就是友谊的意义。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a59
msgid "If you ever get stuck in a mission, retreating is always an option! Isn't that right?"
msgstr "如果任务中卡住了，撤退永远是个选择！对吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a70
msgid "Boss! The R&D Team is screwing around! They are playing with the cardboard boxes! What the hell is that?!"
msgstr "BOSS！研发班在瞎搞！他们在玩纸箱！那到底是什么鬼？！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a71
msgid "In combat, running out of ammo is a death sentence. Steal some from the enemy if you have to, or call for resupply, or search around the area! Good luck!"
msgstr "战斗中弹药耗尽等于死刑。必要时从敌人那里偷一些，或者呼叫补给，或者搜索周围区域！祝你好运！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a72
msgid "You can't attack while reloading. So find someplace to take cover when you do! That's what's kept me alive all these years."
msgstr "装弹时无法攻击。所以装弹时找个地方掩护！这就是我这么多年活下来的秘诀。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a73
msgid "Enemy hiding out of sight? Try the night-vision goggles. That's what I do."
msgstr "敌人藏在视线外？试试夜视镜。我就是这么做的。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a74
msgid "Suppressors don't last forever. Use them enough and they wear out. Best to keep an eye on how long they've got left."
msgstr "消音器不是永久的。用得多了就会磨损。最好留意剩余寿命。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a75
msgid "Whoa, almost screwed up back there... All because I didn't read the intel in the BRIEFING FILES first... You gotta use your brains, not just your brawn."
msgstr "哇，刚才差点搞砸了……都怪我没先读简报文件里的情报……你得用脑子，不能只靠蛮力。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a76
msgid "They say when you CO-OPS with somebody, you can tell who they regard as the greatest hero they've gone CO-OPS with. "
msgstr "据说和别人进行合作任务时，能看出谁是他们合作过的最伟大的英雄。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a77
msgid "I always go into a mission empty-handed. I can always borrow gear from my teammates."
msgstr "我总是空手进入任务。反正可以从队友那里借装备。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a78
msgid "Flying enemies are weak against explosions. Damage 'em with a missile and it might create an opening... right, Boss?"
msgstr "飞行敌人怕爆炸。用导弹造成伤害，也许能制造破绽……对吧，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a79
msgid "The canopies on attack choppers are pretty solid, but you can break though them. It's the only way to get at the pilot inside... But you probably already knew that."
msgstr "攻击直升机的座舱盖相当坚固，但你可以打破它。这是接近里面飞行员的唯一方法……不过你大概已经知道了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a90
msgid "A helicopter uses its tail rotor to combat counter-torque. In other words, without it the chopper can't fly straight. You could say it's like the chopper's jugular vein."
msgstr "直升机用尾桨对抗反扭矩。换句话说，没有它直升机就无法直线飞行。可以说它是直升机的颈静脉。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a91
msgid "My instructor told me when you get up close and personal with the enemy, CQC works better than a rifle! I'm gonna practice every chance I get!"
msgstr "教官说过，近身贴近敌人时，CQC比步枪更好用！我得一有机会就练！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a92
msgid "It's tough to see where you're going in the Ruinas de Xochiquetzal in Central Heredia. I wouldn't trust my eyes too much if I were you..."
msgstr "在埃雷迪亚中部的索奇克察尔遗迹，很难看清前方。要是我的话，可不会太相信自己的眼睛……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a93
msgid "The last war I was in, I attached an extra weapon to the barrel of my assault rifle. It's kind of tricky to switch between them, but once you get used to it you'll wonder how you ever got on without it."
msgstr "上次参战时，我在突击步枪的枪管上装了附加武器。切换起来有点麻烦，不过习惯了就离不开了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a94
msgid "Sneak up behind the enemy and hold 'em up, then make sure you Fulton recover 'em! ...That's how I do it."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a95
msgid "Night-vision goggles aren't just useful at night. Foggy jungle, enemy smoke grenade - they come in handy anytime you can't see more than a few feet in front of you."
msgstr "夜视仪不只晚上有用。雾大的丛林、敌人的烟雾弹——只要前方几尺外看不清，它就能派上用场。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a96
msgid "If only we had a weapon that let us capture those enemy heavy weapons without hurting them... maybe we could take them back to Mother Base and put them to use..."
msgstr "要是有一把武器能不伤分毫地夺取敌方重武器就好了……说不定还能带回母基地加以利用……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a97
msgid "Yup... MSF needs all the firepower it can get. Like mechs, for example. Capturing them from the enemy would be quickest. Or, there's the other way..."
msgstr "是啊……MSF需要一切能到手的火力。比如机甲。从敌人手里抢最快。或者，还有别的办法……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a98
msgid "There's two basic ways to take on a unit with a mech. Overwhelm them with sheer firepower, or take out the soldiers first and then capture the machine. Decisions, decisions..."
msgstr "对付有机甲的部队，基本有两种打法。用压倒性火力强攻，或者先解决士兵再夺取机器。真难抉择……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374a99
msgid "You're not gonna believe this, but... I saw this cat-thing rowing a little boat down by the Caribbean coast! Next time you're on a mission down there, see if you can find it!"
msgstr "你肯定不信，可是……我在加勒比海岸看见一只猫一样的东西在划小船！下次你去那边执行任务，找找看！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab0
msgid "I love UMAs. Monsters, too... you know anybody who knows a lot about rare creatures? I want to pick their brain! Pick it CLEAN!"
msgstr "我最爱未知生物了。怪物也是……你认识谁很懂稀有生物吗？我想向他请教！请教个精光！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab1
msgid "I don't care how good they taste, I HATE eating cold rations! If only we could grill 'em up a little... Then I'd be happy."
msgstr "我不管冷的军粮多好吃，我就是讨厌吃！要是能稍微烤一下……我就满足了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab2
msgid "Flying weapons are usually pretty noisy. They ought to be easy to find if you've got a Surround Indicator... right, Boss?"
msgstr "飞行武器通常都很吵。只要有环绕指示器，应该很容易找到……对吧，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab3
msgid "They say there are monsters out there somewhere in this country, and if you hunt one down, you can use it to develop amazing gear. Of course, I don't believe a word of it."
msgstr "听说这个国家的某处有怪物，猎到它就能开发出惊人的装备。当然，我一个字都不信。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab4
msgid "The fuel tanks on the enemy's heavy weapons are painted red. Seems like that'd be a good place to shoot them."
msgstr "敌方重武器的燃料罐漆成了红色。那地方看起来很适合射击。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab5
msgid "Boss, did you know there's some kind of miracle gun that makes the sky do your bidding? Think we could make one here?"
msgstr "BOSS，你知道有种神奇的枪能让天空听你号令吗？咱们这儿也能造一把吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab6
msgid "Missile-type weapons are heavy and have low ammo capacity. But they pack the most firepower of any portable weapon. Exactly what you need against heavy weapons."
msgstr "导弹类武器又重，弹药又少。但它的火力是所有便携武器里最强的。对付重武器正合适。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab7
msgid "Machine guns are powerful and carry a lot of ammo, so they're perfect for taking down mechs. Of course, they're also heavy and tough to handle..."
msgstr "机枪威力大、弹药多，打机甲再合适不过。当然，它也很重，不好操作……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab8
msgid "Sniper rifles are the best for precision long-range shots. A lot of them even fire armor-piercing rounds."
msgstr "狙击步枪最适合远距离精准射击。很多还能发射穿甲弹。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ab9
msgid "Submachine guns are easy to aim, and they've got good rapid fire! Plus you can use them with a shield. You just have to get used to the muzzle jump, that's all."
msgstr "冲锋枪好瞄准，连射也快！还能配盾使用。只要习惯枪口上跳就行了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad0
msgid "Did you hear? Somebody said they saw \"God\" inside a truck somewhere..."
msgstr "听说有人在某处卡车里看见了“神”……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad1
msgid "Assault rifles are all-around solid weapons in every respect. There's lots of custom parts for them, too, so it's worth doing some R&D..."
msgstr "突击步枪各方面都很均衡可靠。改装零件也多，值得研发一下……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad2
msgid "Shotguns are AWESOME! They can blow away just about anything in one shot. Only problem is they got short range and low ammo."
msgstr "霰弹枪超棒！几乎一枪就能轰飞任何东西。唯一的问题是射程短、弹药少。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad3
msgid "Handguns have short range and low firepower, but they've got great accuracy at close range and high-caliber ammo that stops targets in their tracks. And if you know when and how to use them, you can conserve your rifle ammo... That's a quote from the Boss. I learned it by heart!"
msgstr "手枪射程短、火力弱，但近距离精准度高，大口径弹药能让目标当场停住。懂得何时如何使用，还能省下步枪弹药……这是BOSS说的。我背得滚瓜烂熟！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad4
msgid "The two things you gotta remember for sniper rifles are \"crouch\" and \"aim.\" I guess 'cause it makes your hands shake less!"
msgstr "狙击步枪要记住两点：“蹲下”和“瞄准”。大概是能让手少抖吧！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad5
msgid "If you're using a one-handed weapon, you can equip a shield at the same time. And when it's not on your arm, it'll protect your back... isn't that what you said, Boss?"
msgstr "用单手武器时，可以同时装备盾牌。不在手臂上时，它还能护住后背……这是你说的吧，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad6
msgid "Handguns are great for indoors and in tight spaces... 'cause they're easy to aim."
msgstr "手枪适合室内和狭窄空间……因为容易瞄准。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad7
msgid "You're telling me armor-piercing rounds go through shields and helmets?! Man, talk about punch."
msgstr "你是说穿甲弹能打穿盾牌和头盔？！威力真猛。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad8
msgid "Large-caliber handguns are the best tool for stopping the enemy from acting. AND they let you use CQC at the same time. If you find yourself surrounded, try going with a handgun."
msgstr "大口径手枪最能阻止敌人行动，还能同时用CQC。被包围时试试手枪。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ad9
msgid "You ever hear of these \"battle cries\" that make amazing things happen sometimes when you say them? Crazy, huh?"
msgstr "你听说过\"战吼\"吗？喊出来有时会发生神奇的事。很疯狂吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af0
msgid "You know what I like about working for you, Boss? You know how to complete a mission without hurting anybody, without them even knowing you're there."
msgstr "知道我喜欢为你工作的哪点吗，BOSS？你能不伤一人完成任务，他们甚至不知道你来过。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af1
msgid "I thought my gear felt a little heavy... Turns out my guns alone weighed 20 pounds! No wonder my PSYCHE decreased. Heavier isn't always better, I guess."
msgstr "难怪觉得装备有点重……光枪就重20磅！难怪精神下降了。看来重不一定好。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af2
msgid "Back when I was a rookie, I used to spray my assault rifle all over the place and waste ammo... You gotta stay focused, aim, and be smart with your trigger finger, fire in small bursts. It's not how many shots you fire, it's how many hit the target. I wish I'd realized that sooner... "
msgstr "我当新兵时，常乱扫突击步枪浪费弹药……要专注、瞄准、管好扳机，短点射。重要的不是开了几枪，而是命中几发。真希望早点明白……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af3
msgid "Timing is everything in consecutive CQC, y'know. Gotta be cool, press the button at just the right time..."
msgstr "连续CQC全靠时机，懂吗。要冷静，在恰当时机按键……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af4
msgid "Boss, if you find me lying face down on the battlefield you gotta revive me! Uh, but no mouth-to-mouth, please!"
msgstr "BOSS，要是看到我趴在地上，你得救我！呃，但别做人工呼吸！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af5
msgid "In training I got CQC-thrown against a wall and got knocked out. Felt like it hurt at least twice as bad as a usual throw, too..."
msgstr "训练时我被CQC摔到墙上昏了过去。感觉比普通摔法疼至少两倍……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af6
msgid "I bet even the toughest missions wouldn't be so bad for a two-man cell!  I'm gonna go look for somebody to team up and fight with!"
msgstr "我敢说再难的任务，两人小队也能应付！我要去找个搭档一起战斗！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af7
msgid "Hey Boss, can you teach me how to reload?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af8
msgid "Reloading leaves you temporarily vulnerable. Timing your reloads is just as crucial as timing your shots. Isn't it, Boss?"
msgstr "换弹时会暂时毫无防备。把握换弹时机和把握开枪时机一样关键。对吧，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374af9
msgid "Hey Boss! Thanks for always listening to us grunts. I mean, even we can teach you something once in a while. Right?!"
msgstr "嘿BOSS！谢谢你总听我们这些小兵说话。偶尔我们也能教你点东西。对吧？！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b10
msgid "Chicks dig a man who smells like success!"
msgstr "女人爱闻着像成功的男人！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b11
msgid "Ahh, I get it... GMP is the sum total of MSF's income... the same way GNP expresses a country's total income..."
msgstr "啊，我懂了……GMP是MSF总收入的总和……就像GNP代表国家总收入一样……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b12
msgid "If the next mission looks too tough for you, take a break and focus on recruiting or developing weapons... Yeah, that's right, never be in too big of a hurry!"
msgstr "下个任务太难的话，就歇歇，专注招募或开发武器……对，别太着急！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b13
msgid "In MISSION PREP we have to be careful not just about what gear we bring, but what uniform we wear. Right, Boss?"
msgstr "任务准备时不仅要注意带什么装备，还要注意穿什么制服。对吧，BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b14
msgid "Check out the MAP to see where the exits are. Pretty handy if you ever get lost."
msgstr "查看地图找出口。迷路时很方便。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b15
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b16
msgid "I think we could do a lot better job if we had stronger guns. We oughta get working on developing some new weapons!"
msgstr "有更强的枪我们能干得更好。该开发新武器了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b17
msgid "My great-grandpa used to tell me, \"Sonny, bananas are good for more than just eatin'.\""
msgstr "我曾祖父常说：\"孩子，香蕉不只用来吃。\""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b18
msgid "Boss, let me deploy on EXTRA OPS! I can handle it!"
msgstr "BOSS，让我去额外任务吧！我能行！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b19
msgid "I've seen female soldiers being held prisoner. But I wasn't able to save them..."
msgstr "我见过被囚禁的女兵。但我没能救她们……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b30
msgid "If a target's helmet is getting in the way, shoot it off with a bullet. It works best if you do it before they notice you. Right?"
msgstr "目标头盔碍事的话，用子弹打掉。趁他们没发现你时最有效。对吧？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b31
msgid "How fast a tranq dart works depends on where it hits... Ack, what the--? Unnhh... ZZZZ..."
msgstr "麻醉镖生效快慢取决于命中部位……呃，什么——？唔……ZZZZ……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b32
msgid "You gotta turn away as soon as you throw a stun grenade or you'll get stunned, too... Thanks for the tip, Boss!"
msgstr "扔完闪光弹得赶紧转身，不然自己也会被闪到……多谢提醒，BOSS！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b33
msgid "One day, we'll have the science to turn a man invisible. And when that day comes... heh heh."
msgstr "总有一天，科学能让人隐形。等那天到来……嘿嘿。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b34
msgid "When you're using a sniper rifle, slow down, take a deep breath, and concentrate. It's true... you can actually feel your hands get steadier!"
msgstr "用狙击枪时，放慢节奏，深吸一口气，集中精神。真的……你能感觉到手变稳了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b35
msgid "A man's got to eat to live. If you forget to bring food along on a mission, you better be damn good..."
msgstr "人活着就得吃饭。出任务要是忘了带吃的，那你最好够强……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b36
msgid "Man, I could go for a nice cold soda... That'd really hit the spot..."
msgstr "唉，真想喝罐冰镇汽水……那才叫爽……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b37
msgid "The Analyzer tells you how good a soldier is, so you can pick the best ones to recruit... That's the most logical way to go about it."
msgstr "分析仪能看出士兵有多强，方便你挑最好的招募……这是最合理的做法。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b38
msgid "I like the M10... It's got a decent rate of fire and you can AUTO AIM it from a good distance."
msgstr "我喜欢M10……射速不错，还能在远距离自动瞄准。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b39
msgid "My dream is to invent a weapon that lets you Fulton recover somebody from a distance..."
msgstr "我的梦想是发明一种能远距离富尔顿回收人员的武器……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b50
msgid "So what if you get knocked out? A few good smacks and you'll wake right up!"
msgstr "被放倒又怎样？扇几巴掌就醒了！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b51
msgid "Every mech has a weakness, no matter how big it is... And I intend to find it!"
msgstr "再大的机甲也有弱点……我一定要找出来！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b52
msgid "I heard there's a suit that makes your footsteps almost silent. Imagine how useful that'd be for sneaking up on people from behind."
msgstr "听说有种衣服能让脚步声几乎消失。想想从背后偷袭有多好用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b53
msgid "You ever try running around lugging a big, heavy weapon? It ain't easy. Ain't fast, either..."
msgstr "你试过扛着重武器到处跑吗？不容易，也跑不快……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b54
msgid "With a high enough morale, a soldier can do things he never thought possible. Me, I'm ready to rock!"
msgstr "士气够高，士兵就能做到想都不敢想的事。我嘛，随时准备大干一场！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b55
msgid "The golden rule of staff management is, let people do what they do best. So, where do you need me to go?"
msgstr "人员管理的黄金法则就是让人干最擅长的事。说吧，要我去哪？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b56
msgid "Comrades, lets keep communication tight!  What...? You can't find the right words!? Well then make sure you set your \"CO-OPS COMM\" in \"MISSION PREP\" so it doesn't happen again!"
msgstr "兄弟们，保持联络畅通！什么……？找不到合适的词！？那就在\"任务准备\"里设好\"合作任务通讯\"，别再出这岔子！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b57
msgid "You know when you get a package, and it's exactly what you needed the most? I always get a little misty when that happens..."
msgstr "你懂那种收到包裹、正好是你最需要的东西的感觉吗？每次我都有点想哭……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b58
msgid "If I ever manage to get a girlfriend, I wanna take her inside a cardboard box... and spend some quality time together..."
msgstr "要是能交到女朋友，我想带她钻进纸箱里……共度美好时光……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374b59
msgid "I wonder if you could use a cardboard box as a step to get up to places you couldn't usually reach by yourself..."
msgstr "不知道能不能用纸箱垫脚，爬到平时够不到的地方……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e30
msgid "I coulda sworn I saw a guy who looked just like me... Hm. Must have been a coincidence."
msgstr "我发誓看到个长得跟我一模一样的人……嗯，肯定是巧合。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e31
msgid "It's nice to have a place to come back home to. I'm glad I joined up with you."
msgstr "有个能回来的地方真好。很高兴加入了你们。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e32
msgid "The food ain't too bad here. 'Course, it's nothing like my ma's."
msgstr "这儿的伙食还不错。当然，跟我妈做的没法比。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e33
msgid "I got a wife and daughter back in my home country. Gotta work hard so they can eat."
msgstr "我老家还有老婆和女儿。得拼命干活，让她们吃上饭。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e34
msgid "Boss, MSF is more than just you. Don't forget that."
msgstr "BOSS，MSF不只是你一个人的。别忘了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e35
msgid "I'm saving up my pay to buy a house and get married!"
msgstr "我在攒工资，准备买房结婚！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e36
msgid "Man... I'm sick of people treating me like a rookie! Ugh..."
msgstr "唉……真受够被人当新兵了！烦……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e37
msgid "Yesterday's enemy is today's ally..."
msgstr "昨日的敌人是今日的盟友……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e38
msgid "You wanna know what's the most powerful weapon known to man? A good poker face."
msgstr "你知道人类已知最强的武器是什么吗？一张扑克脸。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e39
msgid "Need some luck? Stick with me and maybe some of mine will rub off."
msgstr "需要点运气？跟着我，说不定能沾点光。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e50
msgid "This place is full of morons... That's why I love it so much."
msgstr "这地方全是蠢货……所以我爱死这里了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e51
msgid "Call me... ah, forget it. Call me whatever you want."
msgstr "叫我……算了。随便你怎么叫。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e52
msgid "Check out this tattoo. Each one of these stars stands for a battlefield I've slogged through... they're actually just stickers, but still..."
msgstr "看看这纹身。每颗星都代表我爬过的一个战场……其实都是贴纸，不过嘛……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e53
msgid "Support is just as crucial as combat! Anything you need, let me know!"
msgstr "支援和战斗一样重要！有需要就找我！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e54
msgid "I need a mission that REALLY gets me motivated..."
msgstr "我需要一个真让我有干劲的任务……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e55
msgid "The bacon in the mess hall was extra crispy this morning. I feel like I can do anything today."
msgstr "今早食堂的培根特别脆。感觉今天什么都能做到。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e56
msgid "Boss! That magazine I lent you before the last mission. Can I have it--what?! You left it out there?! I hadn't finished reading it!!"
msgstr "BOSS！上次任务前借你的那本杂志。能还我——什么？！你丢在外面了？！我还没看完呢！！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e57
msgid "Give me an order, Boss. I'm not what you'd call a self-starter."
msgstr "下命令吧，BOSS。我不是主动找活干的人。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e58
msgid "I got two yolks in my egg this morning. So I'm gonna work twice as hard today! ...Or at least complain half as much!"
msgstr "今早我的蛋里有两个蛋黄。所以今天我要加倍努力！……至少少抱怨一半！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e59
msgid "Boss! Send me into battle! I can handle it!"
msgstr "BOSS！派我上战场！我能行！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e70
msgid "I can never seem to balance work and pleasure. 'Cause whatever I'm working on turns into pleasure."
msgstr "我总平衡不了工作和娱乐。因为我干的活最后都变成娱乐。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e71
msgid "Hey Boss, let's get as many new guys as we can and make MSF into something REAL big!"
msgstr "嘿BOSS，咱们多招点新人，把MSF做大做强！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e72
msgid "We got skills, too, Boss! Take a look and see!"
msgstr "我们也有本事，BOSS！来看看吧！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e73
msgid "When's the party gonna start, amigo?"
msgstr "派对什么时候开始，朋友？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e74
msgid "Wish I could see the Loch Ness Monster or Quetzalcoatl once in my life..."
msgstr "真希望这辈子能见一次尼斯湖水怪或羽蛇神……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e75
msgid "Boss! He says there's no Santa Claus! Santa's real, isn't he?!"
msgstr "BOSS！他说没圣诞老人！圣诞老人是真的吧？！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e76
msgid "Boss! He says Santa Claus is real! There's no such thing as Santa, is there?!"
msgstr "BOSS！他说圣诞老人是真的！圣诞老人根本不存在吧？！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e77
msgid "I may not look it, but I'm turning 48 this year."
msgstr "我可能看不出来，但我今年就48了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e78
msgid "I'll be honest. I don't think I'm good enough. But I want to be. And I'm training hard."
msgstr "说实话，我觉得自己还不够格。但我想变强。我正拼命训练。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e79
msgid "Give yourself a little break once in a while, Boss."
msgstr "偶尔也给自己放个假吧，BOSS。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e90
msgid "I like you."
msgstr "我喜欢你。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e91
msgid "Everything about this place is hot, hot. The weather, the work..."
msgstr "这地方什么都热，热。天气、工作……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e92
msgid "I'm a mountain boy. All this water, and boats and stuff... erk. Give me a mission, quick..."
msgstr "我是山里长大的。这么多水、船什么的……呃。快给我个任务吧……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e93
msgid "It's an honor to serve under a hero like you."
msgstr "能在您这样的英雄手下效力，是我的荣幸。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e94
msgid "I can't sleep at night unless I clean my gun once a day. I'm itching for an overhaul..."
msgstr "一天不擦枪我就睡不着。手痒想大保养了……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e95
msgid "Thanks for the Costa Rican coffee. Best I ever tasted."
msgstr "谢谢你的哥斯达黎加咖啡。最好喝的。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e96
msgid "My wife was always good to me. Guess that's what \"love\" is."
msgstr "我妻子一直对我很好。大概这就是爱吧。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e97
msgid "If I die, we'll meet again in the next life. As comrades."
msgstr "如果我死了，来世再见。以同志的身份。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e98
msgid "One thing I've realized since I got here - there's all kinds of people in this world."
msgstr "来这里之后我明白了一件事——这世上什么样的人都有。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374e99
msgid "Take a look at these guns. I was the arm wrestling champion of my hometown two years running. And runner-up the year before that, and champion the year before THAT."
msgstr "看看这些枪。我连续两年是家乡的掰手腕冠军。再往前一年是亚军，再往前一年又是冠军。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb0
msgid "Can we have curry on Friday? I love curry!"
msgstr "周五能吃咖喱吗？我爱咖喱！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb1
msgid "I used to be in the army, but the government sold us out. Is there anything worth risking your life for anymore?"
msgstr "我以前在军队，但政府把我们卖了。现在还有什么值得拿命去拼的吗？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb2
msgid "You stay here too long, you start losing track of what day it is."
msgstr "在这儿待久了，就分不清今天是几号了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb3
msgid "Ready for duty, chief!"
msgstr "准备就绪，长官！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb4
msgid "I like to CALL people on the radio while I'm on a mission. It's a good way to get useful info, and it reminds me I'm not alone out there."
msgstr "出任务时我喜欢用无线电呼叫别人。既能拿到有用情报，也让我知道自己不是孤身一人。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb5
msgid "I'm a slave to fashion. I collect T-shirts in my spare time."
msgstr "我是时尚的奴隶。空闲时收集T恤。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb6
msgid "It's important to know what to wear, even on the battlefield. The right clothes for the right occasion."
msgstr "知道该穿什么很重要，哪怕在战场上。什么场合穿什么衣服。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb7
msgid "Listen to the waves. Smell the fresh sea air. Soothing, isn't it..."
msgstr "听听海浪。闻闻清新的海风。很舒服吧……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb8
msgid "I got a buddy named Johnny. You know him?"
msgstr "我有个哥们叫Johnny。你认识？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374eb9
msgid "You don't want to over-grill a ration. But if you're just gonna lightly toast it, I say you're better off not grilling at all."
msgstr "口粮别烤过头。但要是只稍微烤一下，我看还不如不烤。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed0
msgid "Hello there! Remember me? We met a while back. Thanks for helping me out then..."
msgstr "你好！还记得我吗？我们之前见过。谢谢你那时帮我……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed1
msgid "I'm no good with people. Please look after me."
msgstr "我不太会跟人打交道。请多关照。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed2
msgid "I was just thinking the same thing as you, Boss"
msgstr "BOSS，我刚想的跟你一样"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed3
msgid "I can't believe you took me in, Boss... I'll do my best not to disappoint, but I'd totally understand if you have to sack me."
msgstr "真不敢相信你收留了我，BOSS……我会尽力不让你失望，但你要开除我我也完全理解。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed4
msgid "Let's put our heads together and make Mother Base grow!"
msgstr "让我们一起努力，把母基地发展壮大！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed5
msgid "If you want to create a change in time, don't blindly abide by society's rules. Be able to evaluate what is right and wrong on your own...   Right Boss? "
msgstr "想改变时代，就别盲从社会的规则。要能自己判断对错……对吧BOSS？"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed6
msgid "You sure love your cardboard boxes, Boss... I love 'em too."
msgstr "你还真是喜欢纸箱啊，BOSS……我也喜欢。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed7
msgid "I got a daughter back home. Haven't seen her in years..."
msgstr "我老家有个女儿，好多年没见了……"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed8
msgid "When this battle's over, I'm gonna go home and be a shrimper. Me and my buddies are gonna pitch in an buy a big boat!"
msgstr "等这场仗打完，我就回家当捕虾的。跟兄弟们凑钱买条大船！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ed9
msgid "I cut my bangs too short."
msgstr "刘海剪太短了。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ef0
msgid "Hah, hah, hah, hah... nothing like pumping some iron!"
msgstr "哈，哈，哈，哈……举铁就是爽！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ef1
msgid "You ever tried chorizo? It's a Mexican sausage. Good stuff, especially when you fry it up with eggs!"
msgstr "你吃过chorizo吗？墨西哥香肠。好东西，跟鸡蛋一起煎尤其香！"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x374ef2
msgid "You a cat person or a dog person, Boss? Me, I'm a cat person... Ah... AH... ACHOO! Too bad I'm also allergic to them."
msgstr "BOSS，你是猫派还是狗派？我是猫派……啊……啊……阿嚏！可惜我对猫过敏。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x37618c
msgid " I am Vladimir Zadornov, and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\""
msgstr "我是弗拉基米尔·扎多尔诺夫，弗拉基米尔意为“和平的统治者”。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x552cb3
msgid "If you see any UMAs, you tell me, OK?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x580daa
msgid "We abandoned our countries. Nothing more."
msgstr "我们抛弃了祖国。仅此而已。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x6747b0
msgid "Why was a legendary hero forced to betray her country? Why was she targeted for assassination by you, her most beloved disciple?"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x6ade44
msgid "(不要)「………」（大塚さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"
msgstr "(不要)「………」（大塚さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x72ae4f
msgid "I've been thinking of giving up on studying birds and learning to fly myself."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0x74af6c
msgid "(不要)「………」（杉田さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"
msgstr "(不要)「………」（杉田さん（声優）一言コメント仮）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0xb73990
msgid "We're not mercenaries. We're not a foreign legion. MSF's a business. A new kind of business."
msgstr "我们不是雇佣兵。我们不是外籍军团。MSF是生意。一种全新的生意。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0xe3d5fb
msgid "...."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang -- read-only: STAGEDAT has no write-back yet, po_import skips it
#: stage/174/lang_myouter_staff_comment_en.olang/0x840500/0xf1c147
msgid "You need a special talent to become cacique. It takes someone great to unite all of las compas."
